function about(){return `<section class="section about-page"><span class="eyebrow">SHADES / COIMBATORE</span><h1>Style is how<br>you <em>carry yourself.</em></h1><div class="about-grid"><span class="asterisk" aria-hidden="true">✳</span><div><h2>A different shade of you.</h2><p>SHADES is a contemporary menswear destination in BK Pudur, Coimbatore. Our digital studio explores the pieces that make getting dressed feel effortless: clean shirts, relaxed trousers, textured knits and layers with character.</p><p>Good style leaves room for the person wearing it. That is the point of view behind this collection.</p><a class="button dark" href="shop.html">Find your everyday</a><a class="text-link visit" href="https://www.instagram.com/shades_coimbatore/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Meet SHADES on Instagram</a></div></div></section>${newsletter()}`}
